OL,3,GNEWSAFlag policy 'will promote
OL,4,Apatriotism' - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Council has approved a new
OL,7,Fflag-flying policy, that a Reform UK
OL,8,Fcouncillor said would "promote
OL,9,Fpatriotism".
OL,11,FIt means only a limited number of
OL,12,Fflags, including the Union and St
OL,13,FGeorge's flags, as well as those of
OL,14,Flocal sports teams, can be flown from
OL,15,Fflagpoles in Centenary Square.
OL,17,FPreviously, Black History Month, Pride
OL,18,Fand the flags of other countries could
OL,19,Fbe flown. Executive members voted on
OL,20,Fthe policy earlier while a red, yellow
OL,21,Fand green Black History Month flag was
OL,22,Fin the square.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
