OL,3,GNEWSAFlag policy 'will promote
OL,4,Apatriotism' - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform councillor Ian Eglin said: "This
OL,7,Fclear approach across the district will
OL,8,Fpromote patriotism, common civic
OL,9,Fidentity and will more closely unite us
OL,10,Fin our shared pride."
